    <item>
      <title>1.6.1</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 04:13:25 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202609050011</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.6.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>Today, Tasks and the Room brought to the new look: page headers everywhere, the Room in a reading column with faces beside each turn, tasks as cards with a real selection, Today's tiles across the width with calendar-leaf dates.</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/computamusic/belongos-releases/releases/download/v1.6.1/BelongOS-1.6.1.dmg" length="8857786" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="XK/5Vmml4YRC0KktlDlONr9qnMSoLYWjIS3Q39VezJOo87TbLiRJEPO14sFiszX8vDSI2aHKLAt2P1evM1sxAA==" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>1.6.0</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 03:52:36 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202609042350</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.6.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>Records brought to 2026: card lists with monograms, grouped detail cards, tabs on the header. Batch review sheet — open every row of an import, fix or remove any, approve from inside. Session review: each item its own card, people get Add as…, open questions can be answered, asked in the room, or made a task, with Franny's draft answers up front and answers filed on the record. Progress card for long imports.</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/computamusic/belongos-releases/releases/download/v1.6.0/BelongOS-1.6.0.dmg" length="8833411" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="MWmZ0n+mZ7rmHtje6fxZ1YT5oGJYCGz6m545bAkPf78qjcaeq4p2b4P3TtgZqA2kl4rRCXfASHUzRHPSSIuABg==" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>1.5.1</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 04:46:29 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202609040044</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>Attaching a file in The Room that can't get through now says so and lets you retry, instead of pretending to save it for later. Uploads get the time a big file needs.</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/computamusic/belongos-releases/releases/download/v1.5.1/BelongOS-1.5.1.dmg" length="8693226" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="YMxsw/mqa+d7zKqKPX+EvpYeQUc/NQ1/ssBWvEH+kYP6kn4gEGH2GHW2eHZHOzbaFld6K6TzSS6GxsTbMmroAw==" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>1.5.0</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 04:03:26 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202609040001</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>Attach a file in The Room — a PDF, a photo, a CSV — and the assistant reads it; a list of people becomes one card to approve, written in full when you do. Facilitators: the people who lead your sessions, under Partners. Session rows line up; a crash when filing a shared recording is fixed.</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/computamusic/belongos-releases/releases/download/v1.5.0/BelongOS-1.5.0.dmg" length="8688779" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="vNNyL5ja8F4ZJrWx9Ch+J5ExIXGtMuq+UH+Wg+4I31g9zakRIHhTdoe5KKzN9LBfKBMVkgB9fL1wtu2ouu+ECw==" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>1.4.0</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 02:24:39 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202609032222</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>Facilitators: the people who lead your sessions — instructors, guides, practitioners, speakers — under Partners, with what they lead, what they charge, and whether you'd book them again. Shared recordings that couldn't be filed are now a row in Sessions with a File now button, and a crash when filing one is fixed. Session item rows line up and stay clear of the tab bar.</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/computamusic/belongos-releases/releases/download/v1.4.0/BelongOS-1.4.0.dmg" length="8654336" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="XmmDowsZauIrnhFHGj/yVnGUWW6z83Laxht5rwERfta6xOofpvoCybHIxvfQlCzePWMEpqjw6BeOArd3mimyBA==" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>1.3.1</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 23:40:52 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202609031938</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>The share menu: share to BelongOS from Voice Memos, Finder, Notes and Safari (1.3.0 shipped without it). Drop a recording on the window, Import Recording… (⇧⌘I), or Open With BelongOS — all transcribed on your Mac and filed with the audio kept. Live transcript while you record, in paragraphs. Before we wrap: the assistant's questions, open loops and ideas, with the records you named beside the words. Recap PDFs download or share; recordings play back in Sessions. The Room no longer scrolls in on every screen.</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/computamusic/belongos-releases/releases/download/v1.3.1/BelongOS-1.3.1.dmg" length="8636657" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Y/RKNGcQMaJUHPWeZtg/8EkB1unfvtaEuWWr/yy/xFEivM3hBGmRFJvpokiHltgDmMqH9dkVA1f7UW+aUOLFCg==" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>1.3.0</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 23:34:39 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202609031932</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>Share to BelongOS from Voice Memos, Finder, Notes and Safari. Drop a recording on the window, Import Recording… (⇧⌘I), or Open With BelongOS — all transcribed on your Mac and filed with the audio kept. Live transcript while you record, in paragraphs. Before we wrap: the assistant's questions, open loops and ideas, with the records you named beside the words — and it can ask on its own toward the end. Recap PDFs download to Downloads or share to Mail and Messages; recordings play back in Sessions. The Room no longer scrolls in on every screen. Demo mode can no longer wipe your workspaces.</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/computamusic/belongos-releases/releases/download/v1.3.0/BelongOS-1.3.0.dmg" length="8589719" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="GiTysw8Nd8FCwwd3UPvDw6lAtPxUqUnTPYK8oIeGb51Hpi8CJbh6d4o9DM8yQPMaz1ZkxnAzNkPudNFu9DSUAQ==" />
    </item>
