      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.12</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>Show mode and Door mode for the night of. Run of show gains durations, cascade shifting and contingency plans. An events calendar, ⌘K commands, ⌘1–⌘9, and duplicate-an-event. The Mac finally renders the brand typeface.</description>
